Description: Standardize inclusion paths and type declaration files for deterministic schemas.
    This prevents non-deterministic schema compilation and output
    mismatches caused by absolute host paths or sandbox environment
    variances leaking into generated binary schemas.
    Implemented by:
    1) Modifying Parser::DoParse in src/idl_parser.cpp to
       track included files using virtual schema-relative inclusion
       names (include_filename) instead of host filesystem paths, and
       updating Parser::Serialize to populate the included_files vector
       using schema_name to strip absolute path details.
    2) Modifying StructDef::Serialize, ServiceDef::Serialize, and
       EnumDef::Serialize in src/idl_parser.cpp to strip directory paths
       from the declaration_file fields of types, so the metadata only
       records the schema filename (basename) rather than layout-specific paths.
    3) Defining and using StripLayoutPath to strip bazel-out and external
       prefixes while keeping source-layout directory paths (like frc/math/).

